SECTION::Escaping

Foo\::bar and code::a\::b:: and a \|| b and \## here, a lone # and | and a back\slash, a trailing backslash \

Characters that HTML needs to escape: a < b > c & 100% ~ ^ { } [ ] and "double" quotes with 'single' ones.

code::
(
var a = "a::b"; // two colons in a string
a.postln;
)
\::
||
::

